 357 017721  7040          CMA
 358 017722  3362          DCA EQUTMP      /ACTUALLY CHECKSUMS ON DECTAPE ARE
 359 017723  1362          TAD EQUTMP      /EQUIVALENCE OF ALL WORDS IN A RECORD
 360 017724  0356          AND CHKSUM      /SIX BITS AT A TIME. BUT SINCE EQUIVALENCE
 361 017725  7041          CIA             /IS ASSOCIATIVE, WE CAN DO IT 12
 362 017726  7104          CLL RAL         /BITS AT A TIME AND CONDENSE LATER.
 363 017727  1362          TAD EQUTMP      /THIS ROUTINE USES THESE IDENTITIES:
 364 017730  1356          TAD CHKSUM      /A+B=(A.XOR.B)+2*(A.AND.B)
 365 017731  3356          DCA CHKSUM      /A.EQU.B=.NOT.(A.XOR.B)=A.XOR.(.NOT.B)
 366 017732  1362          TAD EQUTMP      /A.EQU.B=(A+(.NOT.B))-2*(A.AND.(.NOT.B))
